      hu: ["Az Indus-völgyi civilizáció elődje.", "A lakosok sár-tégla házakban éltek.", "Korai fogászati fúrásokat fedeztek fel itt."],
      ro: ["Predecesor al Civilizației Văii Indusului.", "Locuitorii trăiau în case din chirpici.", "Aici au fost descoperite dovezi timpurii de foraj dentar."],
      en: ["A precursor to the Indus Valley Civilization.", "The inhabitants lived in mud-brick houses.", "Early evidence of dental drilling was discovered here."],
